ne;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;"><br></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#8c8b88;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">We've attached a copy of your policy to this email. It's a good idea to print it out and keep it in your glove compartment. That way, you'll have it handy if you need it, even if you don't have access to the internet. Some immigration stuff, like vehicle permits or visas, might also need you to show a paper copy of your insurance policy.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#8c8b88;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;"><br></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#8c8b88;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">Thanks for choosing Mexico Insurance Services at MexInsurance.com®. We appreciate your business!</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 10pt;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal;" id="docs-internal-guid-70477c59-7fff-9e2e-496d-ef7e385961fa"><br><span style="color: rgb(140, 139, 136); 